1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,500
¿Te ayudo en algo?
Can I help you with anything?

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,800
Solo estoy mirando.
I'm just looking.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,500
¿Puedo probármelo?
Can I try it on?

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,800
Claro, al fondo.
Sure, at the back.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,500
¿Tiene otra talla?
Do you have another size?

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,800
Te traigo la mediana.
I'll get you the medium.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,500
Es un poco caro.
It's a bit expensive.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,800
Mamá...
Mum...

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,500
¿Está en rebajas?
Is it on sale?

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,800
Sí, treinta por ciento.
Yes, thirty percent off.

11
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:29,800
Me lo llevo.
I'll take it.

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,500
¿Puedo pagar con tarjeta?
Can I pay by card?

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,800
Por supuesto.
Of course.

14
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,500
¿Me da una bolsa?
Could I have a bag?

15
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,800
Ya llevo cinco.
I'm already carrying five.
